{"id":"eb9dce8251e2dc37","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-group.md","title":"Group","display":"df-group — Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-group","aliases":["93-df-group"],"display":"df-group — Group","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-group — Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf G\">\\(\\mathbf G\\)</span> is an algebra candidate; its multiplication and inverse operation graphs are denoted by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}\">\\(\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inv}^{\\mathbf G}\">\\(\\operatorname{inv}^{\\mathbf G}\\)</span>, while the identity value is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf G)\">\\(\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf G)\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_G\">\\(S_G\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_G\">\\(\\alpha_G\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_G\">\\(\\tau_G\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbGroup}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbGroup}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_{93}\">\\(Z_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> have their source signatures.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot,\\operatorname{inv},e\">\\(\\cdot,\\operatorname{inv},e\\)</span> 是固定且两两不同的运算符号；它们在所有引用本签名的文件中保持同一符号身份。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group}\\vdash\nS_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\cdot,\\operatorname{inv},e\\},\\\\\n\\alpha_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle \\cdot,2\\rangle,\\langle \\operatorname{inv},1\\rangle,\\langle e,0\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\tau_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S_G,\\alpha_G\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group}\\vdash\nS_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\cdot,\\operatorname{inv},e\\},\\\\\n\\alpha_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle \\cdot,2\\rangle,\\langle \\operatorname{inv},1\\rangle,\\langle e,0\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\tau_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S_G,\\alpha_G\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf G)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_G}(\\mathbf G)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf G|\\;\n\\bigl((a\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}b)\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}c\n=a\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}(b\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}c)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in|\\mathbf G|\\;\\Bigl(\na\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf G)=a\n\\land\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf G)\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}a=a\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\na\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}\\operatorname{inv}^{\\mathbf G}(\\langle a\\rangle)=\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf G)\n\\land\\operatorname{inv}^{\\mathbf G}(\\langle a\\rangle)\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}a=\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf G)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf G)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_G}(\\mathbf G)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf G|\\;\n\\bigl((a\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}b)\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}c\n=a\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}(b\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}c)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in|\\mathbf G|\\;\\Bigl(\na\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf G)=a\n\\land\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf G)\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}a=a\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\na\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}\\operatorname{inv}^{\\mathbf G}(\\langle a\\rangle)=\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf G)\n\\land\\operatorname{inv}^{\\mathbf G}(\\langle a\\rangle)\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}a=\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(e;\\mathbf G)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AbGroup}_{93}(\\mathbf G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf G)\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf G|\\;(a\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}b=b\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}a)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AbGroup}_{93}(\\mathbf G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf G)\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf G|\\;(a\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}b=b\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}a)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group}\\vdash\nZ_{93}(\\mathbf G)\\coloneqq\n\\{z\\in|\\mathbf G|:\\forall g\\in|\\mathbf G|\\;\n(z\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}g=g\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}z)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group}\\vdash\nZ_{93}(\\mathbf G)\\coloneqq\n\\{z\\in|\\mathbf G|:\\forall g\\in|\\mathbf G|\\;\n(z\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}g=g\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}z)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_G,\\alpha_G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_G,\\alpha_G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The group signature uses the same indexed-operation encoding as every other <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-algebra in this book. The abelian predicate adds commutativity to the full group laws, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_{93}\">\\(Z_{93}\\)</span> records the center on the actual carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf G","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot^{\\mathbf G}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{