\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_G,\\alpha_G)","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"Z_{93}","display":false}],"bytes":2451,"backlinks":[{"id":"fd49e6f1efcceae4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf A)$ and $\\mathrm{AbGroup}_{93}(\\mathbf A)$ are the sourced group and abelian-group predicates of [[93-df-group]]."},{"id":"30dce33330cca251","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_{93}(\\mathbf G)$ is the sourced group predicate of [[93-df-group]]."},{"id":"67a70fa38edcc474","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_G$, the unary symbol $\\operatorname{inv}$, $\\tau_G$, and $\\mathrm{Group}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-group]], and $\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}$ is the explicit inverse-limit predicate of [[93-df-profinite]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-group]]"}],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce","ee84ed8b0fae5bc3"]}